# pd/pdk — PROTECTED PDK drop-in root (foundry / NDA content lives here).
#
# Everything under this directory is IGNORED by default so proprietary,
# NDA-covered PDK content (memory-compiler outputs, .lib/.db/.lef/.gds, cell
# decks, UPF/CPF power views, encrypted behavioural models) is NEVER committed.
# Only the tracked scaffolding below — the guide, the manifest template, and the
# per-area/example READMEs — is kept. Each protected subdirectory carries its
# own .gitignore with the same rule, so a real technology drop stays local.
#
# See ./README.md, AGENTS-technology.md,
# and agents/guides/AGENTS-technology-optimization.md.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/manifest.example.json
!/core/
!/corev_apu/
!/technology.example/
